<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">S</span>patiotemporal <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">F</span>orecasting as <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">P</span>lanning: A Model-Based Reinforcement Learning Approach with Generative World Models</h1>
